{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Cadence 是一款智能任務規劃工具，能將你口語描述的待辦事項自動轉化為具體日程安排。它會根據你的日曆與工作時段尋找空檔，經確認後才加入清單，適合需要高效管理時間的用戶。目前該應用提供<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>下載，原價為 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-213.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自然語言生成精準日程</h2>\n<p>使用者只需輸入如「明天統計作業兩小時」的自然語言，App 即可自動辨識日期、時間與時長，並在日曆空白處建議可行時段。其特色在於無壓力設計：未完成的工作會靜默延續至次日，無需擔心紅點干擾；內建專注計時器與回顧功能，協助用戶養成良好工作節奏，且所有數據均透過 iCloud 同步或離線保存，確保隱私安全。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-160-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-161-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-162-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-163-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-164-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-209-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Cadence – Task Planner</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/cadence-task-planner/id6806902304?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:23:56.348702+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:08:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T22:17:33.287084+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:20.113786+00:00","content_hash":"d182e2dff3375a5fc4730b6e4acaecee2012636d2c6271b7a1750b61d3f5b727","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:23:56.348702+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}